  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>While meditating, you gain a circumstance bonus equal to 1/2 your associated ranks to Bluff checks made to feign a condition or lie, Disguise checks to disguise yourself as a stationary object, Stealth checks to hide while not moving, or any other skill check made related to remaining stationary or posing yourself precisely.</p>\n<p>You can also choose to use your associated skill modifier in place of the normal skill modifier for such checks.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
